      <abstract id="wilms-ov.Summary">
        <title>Summary</title>
        <p>The purpose of this <italic toggle="yes">GeneReview</italic> is to:</p>
        <p><list list-type="order"><list-item><label>1</label><p>Briefly describe the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="wilms-ov.Clinical_Characteristics_of_Wil">clinical characteristics</xref> of Wilms tumor;</p></list-item><list-item><label>2</label><p>Review the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="wilms-ov.Mechanisms_of_Predisposition_to">mechanisms of predisposition</xref> to Wilms tumor;</p></list-item><list-item><label>3</label><p>Provide an <xref ref-type="sec" rid="wilms-ov.Evaluation_Strategy_to_Identify">evaluation strategy</xref> to determine if a proband with Wilms tumor has a predisposition to Wilms tumor, identify the genetic or epigenetic mechanism for Wilms tumor, and determine risks for additional medical complications;</p></list-item><list-item><label>4</label><p>Review <xref ref-type="sec" rid="wilms-ov.Management">management</xref> (e.g., tumor screening) recommendations for individuals with a genetic predisposition to Wilms tumor;</p></list-item><list-item><label>5</label><p>Review <xref ref-type="sec" rid="wilms-ov.Genetic_Counseling">genetic counseling</xref> issues including mode of inheritance, recurrence risk, and evaluation of relatives at risk based on the underlying genetic mechanism.</p></list-item></list>
</p>
      </abstract>
